      "sourceHash": "cdad93cf9f34bf16",
      "translationZh": "用 C/C++ 进行 LLM 推理。在 GitHub 上创建账户，为 ggml-org/llama.cpp 的开发作出贡献。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03bbcb1152cbd888",
      "translationZh": "更快的 CPU 提示词处理：“简而言之：使用 VNNI，让 CPU 上的 mul_mat 实现 3-7x 的加速，而且我认为增加的复杂度极低。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4a446d17382127c",
      "translationZh": "为自行托管的 AI 工具提供 VPS 托管服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4732629a7370c71",
      "translationZh": "了解更多 interserver.net",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9af9a7714ea9cab8",
      "translationZh": "打开评论排序选项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b282135d79288da8",
      "translationZh": "这对 ARM CPU（例如 Raspberry Pi 或手机上的 CPU）有帮助吗，还是只适用于 Intel/AMD？我没能轻易弄清楚，但我猜是后者。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b945f7d25d8e9cf",
      "translationZh": "我很希望我的 Raspberry Pi 5 能有更快的 PP 速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2769da8cdc35ea27",
      "translationZh": "到底有多少人真的在 CPU 上做 PP？llama.cpp 在做 PP 时，会尽可能把工作放到 GPU 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76085513a36a33ca",
      "translationZh": "我想这对混合模式（GPU+CPU）也有好处。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "867dbef0e94d4aeb",
      "translationZh": "提示词处理也可以用混合模式？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca6d8ea5fe16307c",
      "translationZh": "这对于搭建由 Ling-3.0-tiny 这类小模型驱动的本地智能体可能非常有用。在纯 CPU 环境下，PP 一直是主要瓶颈，而生成速度其实可以相当不错，尤其是使用 MoE 时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8edd1ce1273071c",
      "translationZh": "其实不太是因为那个……他们的开发流程是，新功能必须先支持 CPU，然后是 CUDA，再然后才是其他所有后端，而且通常都是通过各自独立的 PR 来实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf0448a53a665dcf",
      "translationZh": "加入互联网上最真实的地方",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
